rothers, when you fall into various temptations,"},{"verse":3,"text":"knowing that the testing of your faith produces endurance."},{"verse":4,"text":"Let endurance have its perfect work, that you may be perfect and complete, lacking in nothing."},{"verse":5,"text":"But if any of you lacks wisdom, let him ask of God, who gives to all liberally and without reproach, and it will be given to him."},{"verse":6,"text":"But let him ask in faith, without any doubting, for he who doubts is like a wave of the sea, driven by the wind and tossed."},{"verse":7,"text":"For that man shouldn’t think that he will receive anything from the Lord."},{"verse":8,"text":"He is a double-minded man, unstable in all his ways."},{"verse":9,"text":"Let the brother in humble circumstances glory in his high position;"},{"verse":10,"text":"and the rich, in that he is made humble, because like the flower in the grass, he will pass away."},{"verse":11,"text":"For the sun arises with the scorching wind and withers the grass; and the flower in it falls, and the beauty of its appearance perishes. So the rich man will also fade away in his pursuits."},{"verse":12,"text":"Blessed is a person who endures temptation, for when he has been approved, he will receive the crown of life which the Lord promised to those who love him."},{"verse":13,"text":"Let no man say when he is tempted, “I am tempted by God,” for God can’t be tempted by evil, and he himself tempts no one."},{"verse":14,"text":"But each one is tempted when he is drawn away by his own lust and enticed."},{"verse":15,"text":"Then the lust, when it has conceived, bears sin. The sin, when it is full grown, produces death."},{"verse":16,"text":"Don’t be deceived, my beloved brothers."},{"verse":17,"text":"Every good gift and every perfect gift is from above, coming down from the Father of lights, with whom can be no variation nor turning shadow."},{"verse":18,"text":"Of his own will he gave birth to us by the word of truth, that we should be a kind of first fruits of his creatures."},{"verse":19,"text":"So, then, my beloved brothers, let every man be swift to hear, slow to speak, and slow to anger;"},{"verse":20,"text":"for the anger of man doesn’t produce the righteousness of God."},{"verse":21,"text":"Therefore, putting away all filthiness and overflowing of wickedness, receive with humility the implanted word, which is able to save your souls."},{"verse":22,"text":"But be doers of the word, and not only hearers, deluding your own selves."},{"verse":23,"text":"For if anyone is a hearer of the word and not a doer, he is like a man looking at his natural face in a mirror;"},{"verse":24,"text":"for he sees himself, and goes away, and immediately forgets what kind of man he was."},{"verse":25,"text":"But he who looks into the perfect law of freedom and continues, not being a hearer who forgets but a doer of the work, this man will be blessed in what he does."},{"verse":26,"text":"If anyone among you thinks himself to be religious while he doesn’t bridle his tongue, but deceives his heart, this man’s religion is worthless."},{"verse":27,"text":"Pure religion and undefiled before our God and Father is this: to visit the fatherless and widows in their affliction, and to keep oneself unstained by the world."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]